  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date hereof.\r\rReason: To comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended.",
    "The conversion of the garage hereby permitted shall be only used for purposes ancillary and incidental to the main dwelling and for no other purposes. It shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as 4 Crichton Avenue, Wallington, SM6 8HL It shall at no time be used as a separate residential unit. To ensure the ancillary nature of the annexe accommodation it shall at no time have:\r\ri) a separate postal address, \rii) Its own kitchen or cooking facilities.\riii) separate metres for the provision of services,\riv) a separate and registered Land Registry title,\rv) a separate Council tax account,\rvi) a separate access independent of the main dwelling house.\r\rReason:  To ensure the ancillary nature of the outbuilding hereby permitted is not used as a separate unit of residential accommodation or for purposes other than that incidental to the enjoyment of the main dwellinghouse in accordance with policy 9 and 29 of the Sutton Local Plan.",
    "The development must be carried out in accordance with the provisions of the FIRE SAFETY STATEMENT by NFA Architectural Consultants unless otherwise approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: To ensure that the development incorporates the necessary fire safety measures in accordance with the Mayor's London Plan Policy D12.\r"
  ],
